  "text_digest": "Skip to Main Content Products Solutions Knowledge Hub About Us Partners Zero Labs CXO Support Watch Demo Now Senior Renewals Operations Analyst Bangalore, India Office Departments Job Summary Senior Renewals Operations Analyst Location: Bangalore India Shift Timing: 2:00 PM- 11:00 PM Willing to work Night shift as and when required (Quarter-ends, Month-ends etc) About the role:The Senior Renewal Operations Analyst will serve as the first point of contact for Renewal Sales Representatives, reporting directly to the Renewal Operations Manager. This role is critical in ensuring that all upcoming renewals from our installed base are accurately forecasted in the pipeline. The ideal candidate will provide essential support to the Renewals team, addressing system constraints and diligently managing transaction workloads to assist with renewal bookings on time. What you\u2019ll be doing: Maintain CRM",
